## PR checklist

Use as the execution list; details above only when you need them.

**Backend & connect**

- [ ] `SocialProvider` + `integrationManager.ts`; tests for connect/publish/follow-ups/plugs
- [ ] Connect family: OAuth env **or** credentials/extension rules; `GET /public/social/{id}` → 400 for non-OAuth public connect
- [ ] Extension: cookie catalog, `extension/`, `extensionToken`, refresh route, legal/docs
- [ ] `providerSettings` resolvers + CLI/API shapes documented
- [ ] Analytics allow-list only if `analytics()` ships

**Web**

- [ ] Launch config + preview (+ settings preview wiring) + optional `SettingsAccordion`
- [ ] `social-providers.ts` display + icon
- [ ] **Follow-up comment preview** (if `comment()`): `{id}Preview` + `PreviewScheduledSocialReplies` variant with correct contrast; `ShowAllProviders` + `/p/[postId]`; bento mock `threadReplies` when follow-ups are marketed
- [ ] Follow-up / plug **gates** (orchestrator, `followUp.ts`, `PostDTO`) only if backend supports them
- [ ] `writing-the-post.md` editor row when composer ships

**Catalog & marketing**

- [ ] `channels/catalog/platforms/{slug}.ts` + `seeds.ts`; `available` correct
- [ ] Go-live: three bentos; feature copy matches shipped behavior only
- [ ] Icon strips ×3 + README SVG; compare competitor `channels` if applicable
- [ ] Secret-admin listing tag (no SQL)
- [ ] Spot-check: `/channels/{slug}`, footer links, `/compare/openquok/{competitor}`

**Tools & agent (by gate)**

- [ ] Humanizer: auto from catalog; optional hub blurb
- [ ] Skill Builder recipes (+ payloads) for coming-soon or live
- [ ] Photo Editor + Best Time only when `available: true` (presets / `PLATFORM_WINDOWS`)
- [ ] `tool-surfaces/{slug}.ts` when using Tier-3 copy
- [ ] Agent channel: bentos, CLI/MCP, `buildAgentsChannelFeatureSections` (no fake analytics)
- [ ] Build-backlinks composer bento when go-live with composer

**Docs & API surface**

- [ ] `social-integration`, `connect-rules`, `media-rules`, `per-channel-settings`
- [ ] `public-api-providers/{id}.md` + OpenAPI/SDK/MCP/docs per **public-api-surface-sync** if route is public
- [ ] `cli-examples`, `resources/{id}-examples.md`, `SKILL.md`
- [ ] `threads-and-comments.md` row if follow-ups ship

**Do not**

- Hand-edit `openquok.ts` channel list, `PUBLIC_FOOTER_LINKS`, or per-channel nav for each slug
- SQL-seed listing tags or oversell analytics / follow-ups on extension-only channels
- Ship go-live channel pages with placeholder MP4 instead of bentos
